{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7e6ff4a94dc36ba2d51e1b2aca2992bb7f582e3826e089bb5711f6c5dc8a1e65", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん♪\nわたしのブログ、どうでしたか？", "zh": "你看看，{$P$}先生♪\n我的博客，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d49cfbf1f16b76e1907346552b5e9422119b00a77f2e7d35ee994c5b0d5a1933", "ja": "そうだな、翼の気持ちがよく伝わってきたよ。\nコメントにも、新曲の感想がたくさんあったな。", "zh": "是啊，很能感受到翼的心情。\n评论里也有很多人写了对新歌的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "71c20e3952b5414d94f8279bb1c6ba0cd2b143d479f3bd9a77593179a8b1e00d", "ja": "はい！　みんな、カッコいい曲だって\n言ってくれてるみたいです♪", "zh": "是的！大家好像都说这是一首很帅气的歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4f1ea0c06a92c9b1dd5194fa5c30c8cb4c5f3ea374d7ad9e3bc770647135b04f", "ja": "あっ、でも新曲じゃないところでダンス間違えたの、\nバレちゃってましたね。ごめんなさ～い。", "zh": "啊，不过我好像在不是新歌的地方跳错舞步的事，被发现了呢。对不起啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0e7d386f8cdf4608796c805263bef141e2f54e3916c18d95e832244a8284797d", "ja": "立ち位置を派手に間違えたもんな……しっかり\n覚えるまで、まだまだレッスンしていかないとな！", "zh": "你把站位搞错得太夸张了……在彻底记住之前，还得继续好好练习才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "07c96702b49836e803d5ad6de2b0c17819da8a0358d7b89c2fd86c22807d5392", "ja": "は～い、わかりました！", "zh": "好～的，明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cad1bdaa27b4aea5e433476d409860a8e53b57e29644576dcf58436b4774de18", "ja": "あれ……\n翼、今日は「つまんない」って言わないんだな。", "zh": "咦……\n翼今天没说“好无聊”啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b0cdd239f9d758df523ef2bc5a75f3f49652b1219d73a6383a6ca7b060115798", "ja": "レッスンはつまんないですよ～？\n同じことばっかりだし、キツいし、疲れるし……。", "zh": "练习很无聊哦～？\n总是重复同样的内容，又辛苦，又累人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "22933a4590426961c10d3f31ada750a47ff80b9e6dcd7cd285c4b6aa4d026cde", "ja": "でも……がんばっても追いつけないのって、\nなんか、悔しいじゃないですか。", "zh": "但是……即使努力了也追不上，\n总觉得很不甘心，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bccbe96340f492e52e054ce84d5c9f2be7dd2ede7f3d831e8ba312696d97c634", "ja": "そうだな。\n……それじゃ、頑張るのをやめるか？", "zh": "是啊。\n……那么，要放弃努力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "abaf03ca6edfe5a05d79e2aad607832c988b9dc3c8ae2af713600caad8788f85", "ja": "ううん、その逆です！　わたし、\n「絶対追いついてやる～！」って思ったの！", "zh": "不是的，正好相反！我想的是\n“一定要追上她～！”哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e4757b808fa5f30fed548358d0c58e5f45da971e74696f8fef7d91cfb5eed45b", "ja": "だからこれからも、レッスンがんばりまーす♪\nそしたら、いつか追い越せるかもしれないし！", "zh": "所以今后我也会努力练习♪  \n这样的话，说不定总有一天能超越你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5a7cf0a2083e10864536f5134a9eda7d1fd785998b37b4576c69b5ac1ae81810", "ja": "そうだな。翼なら、きっとできると思うよ。", "zh": "没错。如果是翼，我觉得一定能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "68c2257c26e022149d73d99fd6bf8cd461a9dd358d8367652a1a62107feb3bfa", "ja": "は～い！　がんばりますね♪", "zh": "好——！我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d743342f53e11e257649b7ea5537825989db4cff33fb560daa5e56337117aad0", "ja": "あっ、でも……美希先輩や響さんたちって、\nいつまでレッスンする気なんだろ～？", "zh": "啊，不过……美希前辈和响小姐她们，打算练习到什么时候呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_056_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a4a5321bdd50b2f34b8d4172ee5b1ef8a4cb96d2f1080c8073d7c42b8f176588", "ja": "ふたりとも、わたしよりずっと上手なのに……\nも～！　これじゃ、ちっとも追いつかないよ～！", "zh": "明明你们两个都比我厉害多了……\n真是的！这样下去我根本一点都追不上你们嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
